/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 704.30 Tm (Why can't a project be opened? Check the path \(the folder must exist\). Drag & drop only accepts .nx) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 689.80 Tm (\("Only .nx files are opened"\). A broken nortex.toml produces a message in the status bar.) Tj
