/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 650.80 Tm (1.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 650.80 Tm ("Compiler … could not be started": nortexc.exe must be next to nortex-code.exe or on the PATH.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 634.30 Tm (2.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 634.30 Tm (Linker/runtime errors: nortex_runtime.lib is missing \(next to the EXE, in the parent folder or via) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 619.80 Tm (NORTEX_RUNTIME_LIB\).) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 603.30 Tm (3.) Tj
