/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 555.80 Tm (in the status bar.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 536.30 Tm (How do I open the terminal? Terminal tab in the bottom panel; show the panel with Ctrl+J.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 516.80 Tm (How do I save files? Ctrl+S or File -> Save; Ctrl+Shift+S for "Save as". Unsaved tabs show •.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 497.30 Tm (How do I change the appearance? Gear -> theme, density, zoom, language \(Chapter 9\).) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 477.80 Tm (Edit several files at once? Tabs and split editor \(Chapter 5\).) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 458.30 Tm (Why does the Run button show "Exitcode Some\(0\)"? That is how the IDE prints exit code 0; it is not) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 443.80 Tm (an error.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 424.30 Tm (Why does the IDE report an error for float or struct? These constructs cannot be generated natively) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 409.80 Tm (yet \(NX2001/NX2002\).) Tj
